{"slug":"BETA-Bite-By-Night-soon-165613","_id":"69c9b7cdf9c021b8644a8ba4","title":"*UPD* | Repz hub | [MOBILE & PC]","game":{"_id":"69c88851216dd933b49de16d","gameId":70845479499574,"name":"[TITLE UNAVAILABLE]","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-9e2e5b56356078c7846815c951459808-cc27d80c698f.png","placeId":70845479499574},"features":"Repz Hub | Bite By Night\nhttps://discord.gg/mVRWynJVCx \nOur Discord server(just made)\n\n\n​Version: 1.0.4\nStatus: 🟡 Slightly Detected\n\nSupported Platforms: PC & Mobile\n\n​ Features\n\n​🛠️ Survivor Automation (Tasks)\n​Auto-Repair Generators: Instantly triggers and completes the generator mini-game events.\n\n​Perfect Barricade Dot: Forces the barricade mini-game UI to stay perfectly centered, ensuring every barricade is a \"Perfect\" hit.\n\n​Auto-Escape: Automatically detects when the exit doors are powered and teleports the player to the escape zone instantly.\n\n​Movement & Local Player\n​Infinite Stamina: Bypasses the stamina drain system and locks your WalkSpeed to a constant sprint.\n\n​Noclip: Disables character collisions, allowing you to bypass doors, walls, and \n\n​Visuals & ESP\n​Dynamic Survivor Highlighting: Outlines all survivors with role-based colors:\n​Green: Standard Survivor\n​White: Medic Role\n​Purple: Fighter Role\nBlue: Security Guard\n\n​Killer Detection: Bright red highlight on the Killer to maintain awareness at all times.\n\n​Object ESP: Full highlighting for Generators (Yellow) and Batteries (Cyan).\n\n​Full Brightness: Removes map darkness, shadows, and fog for 100% visibility.\n\n​Combat Enhancements\n​Auto-Parry: Automatically triggers a block/swing when the Killer enters a 10-stud radius (Requires Fighter/Axe).\n​Killer Silent-Aim: Automatically snaps your character's orientation to the nearest survivor when attacking.\n\n​📝 Patch Notes & Updates\n\n​Update v1.0.4\n\n​Optimization: Re-coded the Loading Screen for better performance on low-end mobile devices.\n\n​Fixes\n\n​Fixed: Resolved a crash issue when switching between \"Bite By Night\" and \"Midnight\" themes.\n\n​Fixed: Corrected a bug where Noclip would occasionally reset after being downed.\n\n​Fixed: Improved the IdentifyExecutor check to prevent script errors on budget executors.\n\n​Fixed: Adjusted the Fly logic to prevent \"Rubber-banding\" on high-latency servers.\n\n​⚙️ Technical Info\n\n​UI Library: Obsidian UI UI\n​Theme: Custom \"Bite By Night\" Fiery \n\n​Note: Thank you all for supporting me :> I just started scripting recently, so I'm glad I could provide a script for a big game like this. More updates coming soon!","tags":["Roblox","BBN","Overpowered"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/repzzwtw/.o/refs/heads/main/BiteByNight.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b","username":"repzz","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b-1791434542365.png","status":"offline","id":"698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10}},"verified":false,"views":6573,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-9e2e5b56356078c7846815c951459808-cc27d80c698f.png","likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-03-29T23:37:49.271Z","keyLink":"","editBy":{"_id":"698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b","username":"repzz","status":"offline","id":"698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b"},"discord":"https://discord.gg/2j5F3JGubc","executes":267,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69c9b7cdf9c021b8644a8ba7","editBy":{"_id":"698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b","username":"repzz","status":"offline","id":"698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-29T23:37:49.274Z"},{"_id":"69caad4af75f64afb5b81408","editBy":{"_id":"698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b","username":"repzz","status":"offline","id":"698590eb10146ba1ee4a768b"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-03-30T17:05:14.087Z"},{"_id":"69cab0588eb417451709da